@qala/crdt is a partial port of the following MIT-licensed projects by Kevin Jahns and contributors:

- Yjs (https://github.com/yjs/yjs) — the CRDT: struct store, YATA integration, update encoding v1, Y.Map,
  Y.XmlFragment, Y.XmlElement, Y.XmlText/Y.Text formatting
- y-protocols (https://github.com/yjs/y-protocols) — sync and awareness protocols
- lib0 (https://github.com/dmonad/lib0) — binary encoding (varint, varString, any)
- y-prosemirror (https://github.com/yjs/y-prosemirror) — the ProseMirror JSON <-> Y.XmlFragment mapping

It is not a complete Yjs: no Y.Array/Y.Text root API beyond what XML text needs, no update v2, no
snapshots, no undo manager, no subdocuments, no relative positions. Updates it produces and consumes are
byte-compatible with Yjs 13.6 (v1 encoding). The code was rewritten for scriptc's static TypeScript subset
(no `any`, non-generic classes).
